<h2><span><strong>How to Submit Your Assignment</strong></span></h2>
<h3>1. Take a screenshot of your score (with the assignment name visible)</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Windows</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(Snipping Tool): Open Snipping Tool &rarr; New &rarr; drag to select &rarr; click the Save (floppy disk) icon &rarr; pick a folder, name the file, choose PNG or JPG, click Save.</li>
                    <li><strong>Mac</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(full): Press<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Command + Shift + 3</strong>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Mac</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(select): Press<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Command + Shift + 4</strong>, then drag to select.</li>
                    <li><strong>Chromebook</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(full): Press<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Ctrl + Show windows</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(rectangle key).</li>
                    <li><strong>Chromebook</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(select): Press<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Ctrl + Shift + Show windows</strong>, then drag.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>2. Save the screenshot (clipboard captures)</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <ul>
                    <li>Windows:&nbsp; Click the Save (floppy disk) icon &rarr; pick a folder, name the file, choose PNG or JPG, click Save.
                        <ul>
                            <li>OR</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>Open Paint (Windows) or Preview (Mac), paste with<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Ctrl+V</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(Windows) or<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Command+V</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(Mac).</li>
                    <li>File &rarr; Save As &rarr; choose folder and PNG or JPG &rarr; click Save.<br /><span>Tip: Name it something clear like Homework1_Screenshot.png</span></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>3. Upload to Canvas</h3>
<ol style="list-style-type: decimal;">
    <li>Open your course and the assignment.</li>
    <li>Click<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Submit Assignment</strong>.</li>
    <li>Choose:
        <ul>
            <li><strong>File Upload</strong>: Click<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Choose File/Browse</strong>, pick your screenshot, click<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Open</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Text Entry</strong>: Click the image icon and insert the file.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Click<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Submit Assignment</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(or<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Save</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>to finish later).</li>
    <li>Check for a confirmation or timestamp to make sure it uploaded.</li>
</ol>
